MODULE: FallbackTombstoneAsSet
TARGET: FallbackCommittedOnly
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the bootstrap fallback re-ships a tombstone row as a Set rather than a Delete
PERTURBS: Fallback

--- FIND
    /\ inflight' = inflight \cup {RepairMsg(k, aStore[k].ts, aStore[k].del) : k \in FallbackRows}
--- REPLACE
    /\ inflight' = inflight \cup {RepairMsg(k, aStore[k].ts, FALSE) : k \in FallbackRows}
--- END